ed according to the 2001 Government Finance Statistics Manual (GFSM 2001) may not be available for earlier years. Start/end months of reporting year: January/December GFS Manual used: Government Finance Statistics Manual (GFSM) 2001 Basis of recording: Accrual General government includes: Central Government;State Government;Local Government; Valuation of public debt: Nominal value Primary domestic currency: U.S. dollar Data last updated: 03/2016	2,862.475	3,210.950	3,345.000	3,638.125	4,040.700	4,346.750	4,590.125	4,870.225	5,252.625	5,657.700	5,979.575	6,174.050	6,539.300	6,878.700	7,308.775	7,664.050	8,100.175	8,608.525	9,089.150	9,660.625	10,284.750	10,621.825	10,977.525	11,510.675	12,274.925	13,093.700	13,855.900	14,477.625	14,718.575	14,418.725	14,964.400	15,517.925	16,155.250	16,663.150	17,348.075	17,947.000	18,558.129	19,284.993	20,145.054	21,016.055	21,873.552	22,765.717	2014
